\* Broken on purpose: the watermark is the newest updatedAt in the list, with no cap
\* at the list read time (the code before the fix for the same-second update loss).
\* @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 2
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 1
    MaxHourly = 2
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    AdvanceNeedsFullList = @AdvanceNeedsFullList@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = @SaveRule@
    CapAtListTime = FALSE
    ClockAhead = FALSE
    SameSecondUpdates = TRUE
    WithRepoAdd = FALSE
    WithPageRefresh = FALSE
    PartialListing = FALSE
INVARIANTS TypeOK Converged
